# The Elliptic ultrasonic engine reports a decision, not a distance: the
# channel reads 2 for near and 0 for far. iio-sensor-proxy refuses a proximity
# sensor that does not say where its near threshold is -- "Found proximity
# sensor but no PROXIMITY_NEAR_LEVEL udev property" -- so state it.
SUBSYSTEM=="iio", ATTR{name}=="elliptic_proximity", ENV{PROXIMITY_NEAR_LEVEL}="1"
